  "goodToKnow": "Das Mammut is a mammoth, the woolly elephant of the Ice Age (die Eiszeit). Mammoth ivory figures, such as the 40,000-year-old Löwenmensch (lion man), were found in caves of the Swabian Jura. In compounds, Mammut- means huge: ein Mammutprojekt, eine Mammutsitzung (marathon meeting), ein Mammutprogramm. Der Mammutbaum is a sequoia. Plural: die Mammuts."
